entries[260403] = { ["name"] = "Silas' Sphere of Transmutation", ["text"] = "3 sec cast\nTools: Philosopher's Stone\nReagents:\nPurposefully Potent Potion , Sphere of Sangaurum , Extremely Precise Vial , Sly Rogue's Decanter , Anchor Weed (50), Mystical Cauldron , Expulsom (10)\nCraft Silas' Sphere of Transmutation.\nQuest:\nA Recipe for Success\nZone:\nNazmir\n\nQuest:\nA Recipe for Success\nZone:\nDrustvar\n\nSilas' Sphere of Transmutation\nBinds when picked up\nUnique\nHighlights and allows the player to interact with various cauldrons on Kul Tiras and Zandalar.\nUse: Concentrate on the sphere to transmute it into another object for 1 hour.\n50\nRequires Kul Tiran Alchemy\n(150)\n\"The sphere's surface swirls and shifts, showing different images for brief moments, never long enough to see what they actually are.\"" }
